{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"LAM","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"耶利米哀歌","commonName":"耶利米哀歌","title":"耶利米哀歌","order":25,"numberOfChapters":5,"sha256":"116b5eec352d92466c3407c484861baa5fe24f8d05cb718844c986cf0d754a57","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/LAM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":5,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/LAM/5.json","totalNumberOfVerses":154},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華懲罰耶路撒冷"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"主的怒氣像烏雲一樣遮蓋少女錫安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂將以色列的榮美從天上扔到地上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂發怒的時候並不顧念自己的腳凳。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"主毫不留情地毀滅雅各一切的住處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂在烈怒中夷平猶大的堡壘，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓以色列及其首領蒙羞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"祂發烈怒毀滅以色列全軍。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敵人襲來時，祂收回援手。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂像烈焰一樣吞噬雅各。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"祂張弓搭箭，宛若仇敵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的右手蓄勢待發，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂殺了一切悅人眼目的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將祂的怒火撒向少女錫安的帳篷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"主像敵人一樣毀滅以色列，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吞噬她的宮殿，夷平她的堡壘，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使猶大人悲傷哀哭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"祂摧毀自己的居所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同摧毀花園；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂摧毀祂所定的聚會之處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使錫安的人民忘記安息日和節期。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂在烈怒中棄絕所有的君王和祭司。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"主撇棄自己的祭壇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"憎惡自己的聖所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把耶路撒冷的殿牆交給敵人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們像過節一樣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在耶和華的殿中喧嚷吵鬧。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"耶和華決意拆毀少女錫安的城牆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂拉了準線，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"定意毀滅，絕不收手。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂使城牆和壁壘一同悲哀哭泣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"錫安的城門陷入地中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主已摧毀、砍斷她的門閂。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的君王和首領流落異邦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"律法不復存在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的先知得不到從耶和華而來的異象。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"少女錫安的長老腰束麻布，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"頭蒙灰塵，坐在地上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"默然不語；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷的少女垂頭至地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"我哭得眼睛失明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愁腸百結，肝膽欲碎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為人民慘遭毀滅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"兒童和嬰孩昏倒在城中的街頭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"孩子們問母親：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「哪裡有餅和酒呢？」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們像受傷的勇士，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"昏倒在城中的街頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在母親懷中奄奄一息。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"少女耶路撒冷啊，我該說什麼呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我用什麼比作你呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"處女錫安啊，我用什麼比作你，好安慰你呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的傷口深如海洋，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰能醫治你呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"你的先知所見的異象虛假無用。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們沒有揭露你的罪惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致你被擄。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們給你的預言虛假謬誤。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"路人都拍掌嘲笑你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們向少女耶路撒冷搖頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"嗤笑道：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「這就是那被譽為完美無瑕、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"普世喜悅的城嗎？」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"敵人都幸災樂禍地譏諷你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們咬牙切齒地嗤笑說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我們吞滅了她！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是我們期待已久的日子！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們終於見到這一天了！」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"耶和華實現了祂的計劃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成就了祂很久以前的應許。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂毫不留情地毀滅了你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你的仇敵幸災樂禍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你的敵人耀武揚威。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"少女錫安的城牆啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要從心裡向主呼求！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的眼淚要像江河一樣晝夜湧流，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要不歇不眠。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"你要在夜間打更時起來呼求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在主面前傾心吐意，如水倒出。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要為餓昏街頭的孩童向主舉手禱告。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"「耶和華啊，求你看看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你曾這樣對付過誰呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"母親豈能吃自己生養的孩子？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祭司和先知豈能在主的聖所中被殺？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"「老人和少年陳屍街頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"少男少女都喪身刀下。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你在發怒的日子殺了他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毫不留情。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"「你從四面八方召仇敵攻擊我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同召集人過節。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華發怒的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人能逃脫，無人能倖免。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敵人殺光了我養育的孩子。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/LAM/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/LAM/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/LAM/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}